WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.160
The Pokémon World Championships...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.670
A trial to crown
the greatest Pokémon battler.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.590
Satoshi is currently ranked 99th.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:32.010
He has finally entered the Hyper Class.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:38.170
His first opponent will be
Denji from Sinnoh, Nagisa City’s Gym Leader.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:42.370
Denji is a powerful Electric-type battler
who Satoshi previously faced...

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.770
...when his travels around Sinnoh
led him to Nagisa Gym.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.770
I’m glad have the chance
to battle again.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.240
Me too, Mr. Denji!

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:59.240
Oh, that’s...
An Alolan Z-Ring, right?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.120
Is that an Electric-Z in there?

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:03.190
This?

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:06.350
It’s a Z-Crystal
made just for me and Pikachu.

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:08.250
You and Pikachu...?

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:15.900
Now I’m even more excited
for today’s battle.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.240
Let’s make it a great one!

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.390
Yeah!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.130
The Pokémon World Championships!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:05.620
Nagisa City, the city of the sun,
is the perfect place for a battle this hot!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.700
Sarunori, give them
your best cheer, yeah?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.700
Today, we have
a Hyper Class battle!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:18.080
And here we have
our two trainers for today’s match!

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:24.470
Currently ranked 27th,
Sinnoh’s strongest Gym Leader: Contestant Denji!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.090
Wow!

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.470
Denji sure is popular!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:34.440
His opponent is a Hyper Class newcomer,
currently ranked 99th: Contestant Satoshi!

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.730
Not much enthusiasm
for the away team...

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:42.180
And this battle will be a 3v3!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.170
All right, both sides send out
your Pokémon at the same time.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:50.620
Go!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.710
Lucario!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.220
Rentorar!

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.350
I choose you!

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:54.590
Go!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.010
Rentorar! Gleam Eyes Pokémon!
Electric type!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:11.730
It can see through solid objects!
It can track down prey trying to hide behind thick walls!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.100
Battle, start!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:15.980
Electro Field!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.790
He deployed an Electro Field!

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:25.330
That makes Electric-type moves
more powerful!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.160
I thought you might start
with Electro Field...

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.540
Satoshi’s got a few tricks
of his own!

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:36.790
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.720
Rising Bolt!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.950
Lucario!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:05.200
The combo of Electro Field
and Rising Bolt broke through!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.340
That’s so powerful!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.790
Return, Lucario!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.070
Rest up for a while.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.460
That Electro Field is <i>nasty...</i>

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:27.050
Next up... Gänger!
I choose you!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.270
Contestant Satoshi’s
second Pokémon is Gänger!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.640
Rentorar! Bark Out!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.620
It dodged the Bark Out!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.440
What?!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.900
Psychokinesis!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.300
Night Head!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.520
Good job, Gänger!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.380
All right! You can do this!

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.560
What a tricky Gänger!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.700
Rentorar can’t move a step!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:32.950
Return, Rentorar!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.030
Your Gänger
is quite the opponent.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.380
Not much can bewilder
my Rentorar like that.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.010
Gänger!
Go bewilder ‘em some more!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.140
So... how will you fight <i>this?!</i>

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.570
Contestant Denji’s second pick
is a Spin Forme Rotom!

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.590
Commonly called Spin Rotom!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:06.660
Rotom! Spin Forme! Plasma Pokémon!
Electric/Flying type!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:10.030
It has taken over a fan
that has a special motor!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.930
Huh? A fan?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.210
Air Slash!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.460
Use Night Head!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.500
Both of them are
gliding through the air like it’s nothing!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.560
What a fascinating battle!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.610
Gänger! Ice Punch!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.110
Thunder Wave!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:54.910
Gänger!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.210
Thunder Wave makes
a direct hit on Gänger!

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.410
The Ice Punch didn’t connect!

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:05.790
Paralyzed, huh?

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.930
The paralysis status condition...

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.510
Now! Evil Eye!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.200
The Evil Eye hit!

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.730
This move gets stronger when the
opponent has a status condition!

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.060
Contestant Denji overpowers Contestant Satoshi
with combo after combo!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.240
Gänger!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:36.180
You okay?

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.830
Gänger is unable to battle.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.840
Even though it put up a good fight
against Rentorar, Gänger quickly goes down!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.760
Return, Gänger!

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:57.030
Thanks.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.470
You held your ground well.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.350
Oh? The Electro Field’s effect faded!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.230
We better not let Gänger down.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:16.700
I’m counting on you next!
Pikachu!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.720
Contestant Satoshi’s
third Pokémon is Pikachu!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:22.700
Pikachu, huh?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.590
It’s a battle between Electric types.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:30.450
Electric moves can’t deal
much damage to Electric types.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.090
How will they contend with this?!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.130
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.180
He learned Electroweb?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.350
He caught it!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:45.880
100,000 Volts!

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.060
Return, Rotom!
100,000 Volts!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.980
Go! Elecible!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.500
What...?! Already?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.610
Contestant Denji’s
third Pokémon is Elecible!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.580
And right off the bat,
it activated its ability, Electric Engine...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.760
...taking no damage at all!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:20.900
And when Electric Engine
absorbs an Electric attack, it speeds up!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.390
Elecible...

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:28.810
Now, you’ll get to see
how much faster you’ve made Elecible!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.980
Fire Punch!

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.530
Pikachu!

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.540
Pocket Monsters!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:00.130
It’s so fast!

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.640
It’s capable of that kind of speed...?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:06.440
Elecible! Thunder and Lightning Pokémon!
Electric type!

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:12.400
A single Elecible can provide enough electricity
for all the buildings in a big city for a year!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.780
Iron Tail!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.400
We’ll use Iron Tail, too!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:27.170
Contestant Denji’s Elecible
uses Iron Tail with <i>two tails!</i>

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.320
What?!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.760
Do it!

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.090
Pikachu can’t get close enough!

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:48.470
What a fearsome
twin-tailed Iron Tail!

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.420
Return, Pikachu.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:55.730
You okay?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.150
Lucario! Go for it!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.370
Contestant Satoshi
switches from Pikachu to Lucario!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.540
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.340
Fire Punch!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.360
Wild Bolt!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.020
Shadow Clones!

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:46.820
The Wild Bolt hits
nothing but thin air!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:47.830
Aura Sphere!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.040
Hit them back!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.930
Thunder Punch!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.430
Oh, no...

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.790
Oh? Lucario is paralyzed!

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.270
Thunder Punch took effect!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.160
Return, Elecible.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.660
Go, Rotom!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.880
Use Evil Eye!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:42.340
Contestant Denji skillfully swaps out
his Pokémon to pressure Lucario!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.510
The Evil Eye hit hard!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.390
Lucario can barely move!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.530
Lucario!

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.770
It’s now or never... Reversal!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.520
Air Slash!

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:24.950
Lucario gets back up
and lands a Reversal!

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:29.220
The less stamina the user has,
the more damage that Reversal deals!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.720
A spectacular blow!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.070
Rotom: Spin Forme is unable to battle.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.730
All right!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.350
Ooh... The cheers for Satoshi
are getting louder!

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.200
Make everyone cheer
even louder, Satoshi!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.110
Good job, Lucario!

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:53.600
Can you keep going?

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.590
The Aura Pokémon
lives up to its fame.

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:01.580
It even shook off
its paralysis with that attack.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.450
Is Lucario going to
win this for him?!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.760
Go! Rentorar!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.840
Contestant Denji sends out
Rentorar once again!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:16.320
Two left... I know what Pokémon
Mr. Denji has.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:17.860
Time to finish this quick!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.390
Electro Field!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.400
And there it is!
He takes control of the field again!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.440
Aura Sphere!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.330
Rising Bolt!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.420
Lucario!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:46.380
Rentorar!

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:05.490
Rentorar and Lucario
are unable to battle.

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:08.150
An incredible double knockout!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:12.910
Now the battle comes down
to Elecible against Pikachu!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.760
They took each other out...

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.750
Thanks, Lucario.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.380
That was a great battle.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.410
This is the last round, Pikachu.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.420
I’m counting on you...

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.480
Pikachu!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.790
Go! Elecible!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.650
Both are Electric-types.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.570
Electric attacks won’t do much.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:43.520
And Elecible’s ability, Electric Engine,
means Pikachu is in for a bad time!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.780
Iron Tail!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.610
Wild Bolt!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.660
How can they be <i>that</i> strong?!

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:09.090
Elecible is completely unfazed
by Wild Bolt’s recoil damage!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.560
Pikachu! You okay?

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.350
Electro Field’s effect has faded!

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:21.300
But it’s so huge compared to Pikachu...

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.850
What now, Satoshi?!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.860
Elecible! Use Iron Tail!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.280
Meet it with Iron Tail!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.150
Pikachu lands a spectacular blow!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:52.670
The enormous Elecible stumbles!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.780
You’re quite the opponents,
Satoshi and Pikachu.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:03.350
Your intensity... Your ferocity...
It just makes us even stronger!

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:08.390
Yeah!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.240
Of course you wanna
use Electric moves!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:22.890
There it is!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:24.670
The bond between
Satoshi and Pikachu!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.120
The Sato-Pika-Z!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.000
The Z-Move...
I’ve been waiting for this.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:45.140
Far greater than 100,000 Volts...
1,000,000 Volts!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:51.550
No, even greater than that!
Our super full power!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.430
Pikachu!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:57.860
10,000,000 Volts!

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.630
So that’s 10,000,000 Volts...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.420
Elecible! Absorb it all
with Electric Engine!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:31.310
A standoff against
10,000,000 Volts of power!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.730
What’s this?!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:07.600
Elecible is unable to battle!
Pikachu wins!

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:10.980
As such, the winner is
Contestant Satoshi!

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.670
I won!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.660
We did it, Pikachu!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.190
It’s over!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.390
Contestant Satoshi
emerges victorious!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.620
Based on the results of this battle,

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:35.010
the Pokémon World Championships
rankings will be updated!

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:38.460
Taking down Contestant Denji,

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.880
Contestant Satoshi rises to 64th
in the Hyper Class!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:47.170
You battled well, Elecible.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.840
Satoshi!

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.190
You did it!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:56.110
Go! Thanks for cheering for me!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:00.680
Mr. Denji!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:03.200
That was a shocking
10,000,000 Volts.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.450
It even overpowered
Electric Engine.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:09.040
When I heard you were
gonna be my opponent,

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:12.080
I wanted to win
with the strongest Electric move!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.790
You might just become
the eye of the storm...

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:20.590
...that shakes up the Hyper Class...
No, even the Master Class.

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.800
The Master Class?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:27.800
Yes. Shirona, the Champion of Sinnoh,
is part of their ranks.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.180
Ms. Shirona?

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:35.050
In Sinnoh, Satoshi has overcome
his first Hyper Class match.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:38.730
But he still has
many tough enemies ahead of him.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.380
Now, who will he face next?

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:09.620
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:10.910
Go!

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:13.690
Bad news, Director Sakuragi!

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:15.270
What’s happened, you two?

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:16.880
What’s happened, you say?

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:23.100
The data... The Pokémon data you put
so much effort into collecting is gone!

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:24.710
What?!

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:26.210
Shishi... Shishishi...

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.460
Should I give them
a little punishment, shi...?

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.340
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.890
The Sakuragi Institute
is Under Attack!
